  "Name": "STOCKTAKE_PACKSIZE",
  "Description": "Stocktake Count with PackSize auto-skip on Qty step\n\nStocktake count process that automatically skips the Qty step when the tracking entity's qty matches the MasterItem PackSize, reducing scan time for full pallets. Loops back to TrackingEntity instead of Location for faster counting.\n\nThe Qty skip logic is handled entirely via a WebTemplate on the Qty step using a #Script dbSingle query and ProceedNext auto-submit via hidden div pattern. No PreScript is needed. The OptionalField 'PackSize' must exist on MasterItem for the skip to trigger. If PackSize is missing or doesn't match, the Qty step shows normally for manual entry.",
